message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "DONOR CLASS: Committee-to-Candidate Contributions to the 119th Congress, 2023-2024 FEC Cycle"
authors:
  - name: "Donor Class Team"
url: "https://donorclass.info"
repository-code: "https://github.com/donerclass/donor-class"
license: CC-BY-4.0
type: dataset
keywords:
  - campaign finance
  - FEC
  - Congress
  - PAC
  - political action committee
  - 119th Congress
  - federal elections
abstract: >
  Itemized political action committee (PAC) contributions to members of the 119th United States
  Congress, reconstructed from Federal Election Commission bulk files for the 2023-2024 election
  cycle. Covers 539 House and Senate members, with contributions classified into eight industry
  sectors: Defense, Pharma/Health, Finance, Energy, Tech, Foreign Policy, Labor, and Uncategorized.
  Independent expenditure totals are reported separately and are never summed with direct contributions.
date-released: "2026-11-27"
version: "1.0.0-data-2024"
